ror's posthumous command to devastate loyal Imperial worlds as punishment for his death. When the operation targets her own homeworld of Vardos, Iden and her squadmate Del Meeko refuse to stand by while civilians are slaughtered, abandoning the Empire and defecting to the Rebel Alliance. Now fighting alongside the New Republic, Iden must confront her former allies, including her own father and the vengeful Gideon Hask, as the war races toward its conclusion at the Battle of Jakku.", "summary": "Star Wars Battlefront II is a first- and third-person shooter set across all three eras of the Star Wars saga. Players engage in large-scale ground and space battles using class-based soldiers, reinforcements, vehicles, and iconic heroes or villains from the franchise. Multiplayer modes span maps drawn from locations across the films, while a single-player campaign follows an original story set between Return of the Jedi and The Force Awakens. The game launched in 2017 amid a major loot box controversy that led to the removal of microtransactions and a complete overhaul of its progression system, after which it received years of free content updates that substantially expanded its offerings.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 39, "name": "Warfare"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-wars-battlefront-ii--1", "videos": [{"id": 30142, "name": "Community Update Trailer", "video_id": "8tnGE9R-ZQg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8tnGE9R-ZQg", "title": "Star Wars Battlefront 2: New Planet, Modes, and Reinforcement \u2014 Community Update", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8tnGE9R-ZQg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 13206, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Kae-JjbLsgA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kae-JjbLsgA", "title": "Star Wars Battlefront II: Full Length Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kae-JjbLsgA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 14280, "name": "Trailer", "video